# Chat persistence directory (installed package layout)
#
# When Qwythos runs as an installed Python package, DATA_DIR resolves here
# instead of backend/data/. The env.py migration moves data from the old
# location here on first run and creates a zip backup.
#
# Same contents as backend/data/ — see that .gitkeep for details.
#
# Do NOT commit the contents of this directory — it contains private user data.
